(2) Maximum number of on-site parking for short-term vacation rental occupants;
(3) Maximum occupancy requirements;
(4) Copy of the posted written rules;
(5) Name of the property owner(s); and
(6) Name of the STVRA and contact information.
(Res. No. 24-046, § 1(Exh A), 12-2-24)
